    ## The figures
    
    Section bytes, with the file delta beside each:
    
    | Figure | Sections | File | .text |
    | --- | --- | --- | --- |
    | the budget, `probe-emend-cells-write-xml` over `probe-zip-xml` | 278064 | 282624 | 211664 |
    | over `probe-zip-xml-write`, the cost to a consumer that already links the writer | 205276 | 208896 | 161712 |
